# Incident Report: Clockify Reconciliation Agents - HTTP 401 Headroom API Key

## Status

Fixed on 2026-06-11 13:45 Bucharest.

The failing Hermes default-provider route was changed on both MacBook and omarchy-precision from the broken `headroom` OpenAI-compatible provider to the known-working `ollama-launch` DeepSeek cloud model. Precision's Hermes gateway was restarted so dispatched Multica tasks load the new default.

## Error

```text
hermes provider error: HTTP 401: Incorrect API key provided: headroom. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.
```

